  by: agent  # 1684
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1684
  clock: 15  # 1684
  nonce: '1684'  # 1684
  message: "Bakeoff re-measure of the acceptance property (no external_symbol canonical_name starts with a workspace prefix), self-analysis dev @ 371adbe47c: 107 phantom hypergumbo_* external_symbol nodes (was 116 after supply-verdict:F4). Reached by calls (286) + module_attr_ref (106) — ZERO imports edges, so the IMPORT facet (F3/F4) is CONFIRMED closed (F4's 366->0 imports claim validated; awaits_bakeoff_validation stripped). The 107 residual is dispatch:F3, NOT WI-noham: bare cross-module FUNCTION calls (compute_cyclomatic_complexity, parse_tier_spec via 'from x import fn; fn()') + module-attr refs on constants (CONFIG_FILES_BY_LANG.items, LANGUAGE_ALIASES.get, KAFKA_STREAMS_CALLBACKS.values). WI-noham (obj.method()/self.method()/@property/inherited) landed + closed its own scope (243 self + 533 pretix inherited_calls edges; flagship repros reachable) and reduced this residual only ~9 (116->107) — because the receiver-typed-method portion was small. STAYS VIOLATED: the acceptance property fails on 107 dispatch:F3-owned phantom externals. Remaining owner = a cross-module function-call + module_attr_ref resolution thread (partially helped by WI-gulot alias resolution; 'from x import fn; fn()' + 'mod.CONST.items()' remain). Filed as the next dispatch:F3 target."  # 1684
