- op: discuss  # 0ebe
  at: '2026-07-08T07:42:26Z'  # 0ebe
  by: agent  # 0ebe
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0ebe
  clock: 18  # 0ebe
  nonce: 0ebe  # 0ebe
  message: "HUMAN RULING (2026-07-08): close via option (i) — re-scope + documented scope-out. Fix the ~13-14 statically-resolvable residual nodes (Categories A/B/D/E) as a fresh sub-WI (WI-hotug/WI-huhum pattern); then close INV-nuzas with the acceptance property re-scoped to import+call+attr facets carrying an EXPLICIT documented carve-out for statically-invisible attributes (the 5 scip_pb2 protobuf message classes synthesized at import by _builder.BuildTopDescriptorsAndMessages, and the 3 package dunders __path__/__file__ — none have a static in-tree definition to resolve to). NOT option (ii) route-to-file-node (would change calls-edge semantics for all consumers and misrepresent a protobuf-message call as a file call). Honest-boundary close, consistent with 'explicit gaps over implicit completeness' + closure-evidence discipline."  # 0ebe
- op: discuss  # d9d8
  at: '2026-07-11T20:36:15Z'  # d9d8
  by: agent  # d9d8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d9d8
  clock: 19  # d9d8
  nonce: d9d8  # d9d8
  message: "Executing the 2026-07-08 human ruling (option i). FRESH MEASUREMENT (self-analysis, dev @ 00a2845f2b, 2026-07-11): 27 workspace-prefix external_symbol residual = 8 CARVE-OUT (5 scip_pb2 protobuf classes synthesized at import by _builder.BuildTopDescriptorsAndMessages + 3 package dunders hypergumbo_core.__path__/__file__ and hypergumbo_core.linkers.__path__, all statically-invisible per the ruling) + 2 INV-jukok phantom-test-function artifacts (test_scip_generated.py, ZERO inbound edges, a DIFFERENT mechanism/owner) + 17 statically-resolvable across 4 categories (A/B/D/E). Filed the ruling's fresh sub-WI WI-tanot-nikug-zifak-gugab-bazag-japos-podul-lidoh scoping all four. CATEGORY A LANDED (commit 8dc4100e5f): extended _emit_module_attr_refs's WI-huhum retarget from kind=variable to kind=function (same EXACT-match / references-edge [taint-safe] / scope-shadow guards; WI-huhum's variable-only pin was residual-driven scope, not a function-specific safety exclusion, so its pin test was converted to assert resolution). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (self-analysis before->after): workspace-prefix externals 27 -> 18, the 9 category-A in-tree function reads all resolved (incl. re-exported ones, since WI-hotug CASE A aliasing already populated global_symbols under the re-exporting module). Verification: RED->GREEN via run_behavior_map; 291 py-analysis + 149 L3/L4 coherence tests + full suite (16338 passed) green; py.py at 100%. INV-nuzas STAYS violated pending categories B (in-tree module/package reads -> module_to_file_id), D (stdlib re-exports mislabeled with a workspace prefix -> carry the stdlib name), E (bash hypergumbo external), then the acceptance-property re-scope with the documented 8-node carve-out + close (per the ruling's sequencing: fix all resolvable -> then re-scope+close)."  # d9d8
