      statement: "Workspace-package source at `packages/*/src/` (or analogous monorepo layout) should be first-party. A dependency declaration naming an in-tree workspace package carries that package's tier -- first-party -- because every node standing for one package carries one tier (ADR-0041 §1, project frame, owner ruling 2026-10-25). First-party symbols should preserve their real path, not collapse to a placeholder."  # 66e9
