that consumers counting external nodes read superseded_by (ADR-0057's general gap; WI-borib's agreement sweep is the place to ask); that the npm module stand-ins stop being nodes (demoted, by design); INV-saruf (a filtered compiled-JS file's edges keep an external_symbol source) is a separate open invariant found on the way."  # 1960
